            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A new mechanism linking ER dysfunction to metabolic inflammation is discovered in a recent study by Shan et al. (2017), which demonstrated ER stress-induced rewiring of adipose tissue macrophage polarization by IRE1α activation, leading to impaired systemic glucose homeostasis.</AbstractText>
